Subject: dnn: remove Caffe protobuf leftovers, fix external protobuf builds
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/opencv/opencv/commit/f7ad23157f1b99b59bc9a706e9c7e4c8394947ac
Upstream-status: Accepted in the OpenCV 5.x branch after 5.0.0
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

OpenCV 5.0.0 removed opencv-caffe.proto but kept caffe_io, which includes
the old generated opencv-caffe.pb.h. With PROTOBUF_UPDATE_FILES=ON and the
external protobuf, nothing generates that header and the dnn module does
not compile. The upstream commit moves the generic ReadProto* helpers to
src/protobuf_io and removes the Caffe leftovers. The deleted files are
removed by the recipe before the patch step (pre-patch in Makefile.common);
the generated misc/caffe files are not reproduced here.
Backport for EmberBSD Ports, AI-assisted (Claude Code), 2026-10-28.

